  "qa": [
    "Every sheet has uniform frame dimensions and transparent RGBA alpha; no accidental background.",
    "No linear image scaling on pixel sprites. Integer scales in device pixels; alpha/transparent edges audited.",
    "Pivot and baseline remain fixed frame-to-frame to avoid jitter.",
    "Characters fit 30pt height including peak of jump/sparkles; no essential pixels clipped.",
    "Hit regions are tested with real finger; overlapping objects have priority.",
    "Never use screen physical width as usable app content width; test 250/340/500/640+pt.",
    "Text remains legible on hardware and accessible in Settings window.",
    "AppKit view `bounds` and `convertToBacking` logged on target Mac.",
    "Private persistent Touch Bar path checked against target macOS; fallback public NSTouchBar works.",
    "Licence/provenance checked for all upstream code and generated/public assets."
  ]
